B.apj=new A.jB("Eid al-Adha Mubarak","A day of takbir, sacrifice, family \u2014 and remember: it is neither the meat nor the blood that reaches Him, but your taqwa.","Quran 22:37")
B.apk=new A.jB("Ramadan has arrived","The gates of Paradise are opened, the gates of the Fire are shut, and the devils are chained. Welcome, ya Ramadan.","Sahih al-Bukhari 1899 \u2014 excerpt")
B.apl=new A.jB("The Day of Arafah","For those not on Hajj: fasting today expiates the year before and the year after. And pour out dua \u2014 it is the best day of the year for it.","Sahih Muslim 1162 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3585, weak per Darussalam")
B.apm=new A.jB("Eid Mubarak","Eat before the prayer, take one road there and another home, and let the takbir fill the streets. Taqabbal Allahu minna wa minkum.","Sahih al-Bukhari 953 \xb7 986")
