B.bBB=new A.rV("The Intention and the Ihram","Labbayk Allahumma Hajj \u2014 the talbiya begins everything. What ihram is, when to enter it, what it forbids.","huda-ihram")
B.bBy=new A.rV("Who Must Go, and When","The obligation, the conditions of ability, what to settle before departure, and the reward of an accepted Hajj.","huda-hajj-intro")
B.aPD=s([B.bBB,B.bBy],t.Kk)
B.bBu=new A.EI("Before You Travel","Hajj is answered with the body before the heart: intention, provisions, and the state of ihram entered before the miqat. The journey begins in the intention.",B.aPD)
B.bBD=new A.rV("Tawaf \u2014 Circling the House","Seven circuits around the Kaaba, beginning at the Black Stone, in a state of purity. The detailed guide walks every circuit.","huda-tawaf")
B.bBz=new A.rV("Sa\u2019i \u2014 Between Safa and Marwah","Seven lengths between the two hills, in memory of Hagar\u2019s search. One guide, \u201cTawaf & Sa\u2019i\u201d, teaches both rites together.","huda-tawaf")
B.aK6=s([B.bBD,B.bBz],t.Kk)
B.bBx=new A.EI("The Arrival \u2014 Tawaf and Sa\u2019i","The House of Allah receives the pilgrim with two acts: the circling of tawaf and the walk of Sa\u2019i \u2014 Hagar\u2019s search between Safa and Marwah, made worship.",B.aK6)
B.bBE=new A.rV("The Day of Arafat \u2014 9 Dhul Hijjah","The standing. The Prophet \ufdfa said Hajj is Arafat \u2014 no Hajj without this day. The guide covers the dua, the standing, the departure.","huda-arafat")
B.bBC=new A.rV("Muzdalifah and Mina","The night at Muzdalifah, the stoning, sacrifice and release, the days of Tashreeq at Mina and the farewell tawaf \u2014 walked through day by day in the Hajj walkthrough.","huda-hajj-overview")
B.aJ9=s([B.bBE,B.bBC],t.Kk)
B.bBw=new A.EI("The Days of Hajj \u2014 Arafat to the Stoning","The days the Prophet \ufdfa called the essence of Hajj: standing at Arafat where the religion was perfected (5:3), the night at Muzdalifah, and the days of stoning and sacrifice at Mina.",B.aJ9)
B.bBA=new A.rV("How to Perform Umrah","The complete sequence from miqat to halq \u2014 the Prophet \ufdfa performed Umrah four times; the guide makes it simple.","huda-umrah")
B.aCR=s([B.bBA],t.Kk)
B.bBv=new A.EI("Umrah \u2014 The Short Journey","Umrah can be done any time of year: ihram, tawaf, sa\u2019i, and cutting the hair \u2014 completed in hours. The guide walks it step by step.",B.aCR)
