B.bAy=new A.np("Why Marriage at All","Marriage is described in the Qur'an with four words: sukun (tranquility), mawaddah (affection), and rahmah (mercy) (30:21). Notice what is missing: passion, romance, excitement. The house runs on mercy the way the body runs on blood.",u.dO)
B.bAA=new A.np("The Best of You","The best of you is the one who is best to his wife (Tirmidhi 3895, sahih per Darussalam). And the most complete believer in faith is the one with the best character (Tirmidhi 1162, hasan per Darussalam). The measure of a Muslim is not the masjid face; it is the kitchen face.",u.gq)
B.bAr=new A.np("Mercy Between You","Allah describes the spouses as 'garments' for one another (2:187) \u2014 the closest thing to the skin, covering faults, providing warmth. The garment does not criticize the body it covers.",u.e7)
B.azs=s([B.bAy,B.bAA,B.bAr],t.IV)
B.bAD=new A.Lr("Marriage \u2014 Half the Deen","The Prophet \ufdfa said: when a servant marries, they have completed half of their religion \u2014 so let them fear Allah in the remaining half (Bayhaqi). The home is the smallest masjid.",B.azs)
B.bAz=new A.np("The First Teacher","The mother of every person carries them in weakness upon weakness (31:14) \u2014 and the Prophet \ufdfa was asked who most deserves good company: your mother, three times, then your father (Bukhari 5971). The home is a madrasa whether you intend it or not.",u.kD)
B.bAw=new A.np("Teaching the Prayer","Command your children to pray at seven and discipline them about it at ten, and separate their beds (Abu Dawud 495, hasan sahih per al-Albani). Before seven the prayer is invited, not enforced \u2014 love first, law second, so the law lands softer.",u.h0)
B.bAu=new A.np("Mercy, Not Severity","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah is Merciful and loves mercy in all things (Bukhari 6927). And he never struck a servant or a woman, and never struck anything with his hand except in battle (Muslim 2328). The strongest homes are the gentlest.",u.aM)
B.bAx=new A.np("The Best Provision","The best thing a father can give his child is good manners (Tirmidhi 1952, weak per Darussalam). And the most precious inheritance is taqwa \u2014 it is the only wealth that cannot be lost, taxed, or inherited away.",u.mg)
B.aG4=s([B.bAz,B.bAw,B.bAu,B.bAx],t.IV)
B.bAB=new A.Lr("Children \u2014 The Trust","Your children are an amanah \u2014 a trust. The Prophet \ufdfa said: each of you is a shepherd, and each of you is responsible for his flock (Bukhari 893).",B.aG4)
B.bAs=new A.np("Serving the Family","Aisha was asked what the Prophet \ufdfa did at home. She said: he was in the service of his family (Bukhari 676). He mended his clothes, milked the goat, swept. The man who led the ummah led the dishes.",u.fG)
B.bAv=new A.np("The Family That Prays","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the one who remembers his Lord and the one who does not are like the living and the dead (Bukhari 6407). Dhikr at the door, before meals, at sleep \u2014 small phrases that keep the heart alive.",u.r)
B.bAt=new A.np("Forgiveness in the House","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah has mercy on the man who is lenient when he sells, when he buys, and when he asks for what is owed (Bukhari 2076). The house needs this most: forgive the harsh word before the day ends.",u.kr)
B.aQY=s([B.bAs,B.bAv,B.bAt],t.IV)
B.bAC=new A.Lr("The Home as Worship","The house is not a pause between acts of worship \u2014 it is one.",B.aQY)
B.as5=s([B.bAD,B.bAB,B.bAC],A.ad("z<Lr>"))
