B.b6r=new A.uT("The Quiet War","Addiction & compulsive habits","You are not your struggle. The fact that you are still fighting after every fall is not weakness. Every return matters. Allah says: \u201cO My servants who have transgressed against themselves [by sinning], do not despair of the mercy of Allah. Indeed, Allah forgives all sins.\u201d (Qur\u2019an 39:53)","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","Qur\u2019an 39:53","If you are in danger of overdose or withdrawal, or you are thinking of ending your life, call your local emergency number now. A doctor or an addiction service can walk this road with you; you do not have to do it on willpower alone.",B.b99)
