B.abz=new A.cl("Cleanliness is half of faith.","Abu Malik al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih Muslim 223",null,null)
B.ace=new A.cl("Whoever conceals the fault of a Muslim, Allah will conceal his faults in this world and the Hereafter.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699",null,null)
B.abZ=new A.cl("The upper hand is better than the lower hand.","Hakim ibn Hizam (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1427",null,null)
B.abu=new A.cl("Make things easy and do not make them difficult; give glad tidings and do not repel people.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 69",null,null)
B.abE=new A.cl("The best charity is that given when you are healthy and holding back, fearing poverty.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1419",null,null)
B.abA=new A.cl("Whoever does not show mercy will not be shown mercy.","Jarir ibn Abdullah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6013",null,null)
B.abD=new A.cl("Kindness is never present in anything but it beautifies it.","Aisha (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2594",null,null)
B.abX=new A.cl("Removing something harmful from the road is charity.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2989",null,null)
B.ac8=new A.cl("A good word is charity.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2989",null,null)
B.aci=new A.cl("Two words, light on the tongue, heavy on the Scale, beloved to the Most Merciful: SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi, SubhanAllahil-Adheem.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6406",null,null)
B.ac0=new A.cl("Whoever believes in Allah and the Last Day, let him honor his guest.","Abu Shurayh al-Adawi (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6019",null,null)
B.abo=new A.cl("The most complete believers in faith are the best of them in character.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1162","hasan","Darussalam")
B.abW=new A.cl("Fear Allah wherever you are, follow a bad deed with a good one and it will erase it, and treat people with good character.","Abu Dharr & Mu\u2019adh (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1987","hasan","Darussalam")
B.abQ=new A.cl("Allah does not look at your appearances or your wealth, but He looks at your hearts and your deeds.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564",null,null)
B.ac6=new A.cl("Leave that which makes you doubt for that which does not make you doubt.","al-Hasan ibn Ali (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2518","sahih","Darussalam")
B.abG=new A.cl("Part of a person\u2019s good Islam is leaving what does not concern him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2317","daif","Darussalam")
B.abC=new A.cl("Do not envy one another, do not hate one another, do not turn away from one another \u2014 and be, O servants of Allah, brothers.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2559 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.ac1=new A.cl("A Muslim is the brother of a Muslim: he does not wrong him, nor forsake him, nor despise him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564",null,null)
B.abY=new A.cl("Whoever relieves a believer\u2019s distress, Allah will relieve his distress on the Day of Resurrection.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.abH=new A.cl("Be in this world as if you were a stranger or a traveler.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6416",null,null)
B.abM=new A.cl("If you were to rely upon Allah with true reliance, He would provide for you as He provides for the birds.","Umar ibn al-Khattab (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2344","hasan","Darussalam")
B.acb=new A.cl("Take advantage of five before five: your youth before your old age, your health before your sickness, your wealth before your poverty, your free time before your busyness, and your life before your death.","Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA)","al-Mustadrak (al-Hakim)","sahih","al-Hakim")
B.abO=new A.cl("The best among you are those who are best to their families, and I am the best of you to my family.","Aisha (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3895","sahih","Darussalam")
B.ach=new A.cl("He is not of us who does not show mercy to our young and honor our elderly.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1919","hasan","Darussalam")
B.ac7=new A.cl("The Merciful are shown mercy by the Most Merciful; be merciful to those on earth and the One above the heavens will be merciful to you.","Abdullah ibn Amr (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 4941","sahih","al-Albani")
B.abt=new A.cl(u.aI,"Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 4811","sahih","al-Albani")
B.abp=new A.cl(u.eV,"Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6412",null,null)
B.abw=new A.cl("Richness is not having many possessions; richness is contentment of the soul.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6446",null,null)
B.abm=new A.cl("The most beloved people to Allah are those most beneficial to people.","Ibn Umar (RA)","al-Mu\u2019jam al-Awsat (at-Tabarani)","not yet verified","Ar-Rayaan review pending")
B.aby=new A.cl("Allah makes the way to Paradise easy for whoever travels a path seeking knowledge.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.abT=new A.cl("When a man dies, his deeds end except three: ongoing charity, beneficial knowledge, or a righteous child who prays for him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 1631",null,null)
B.acd=new A.cl("The religion is sincerity \u2014 to Allah, to His Book, to His Messenger, and to the leaders of the Muslims and their common folk.","Tamim ad-Dari (RA)","Sahih Muslim 55",null,null)
B.acc=new A.cl("Whoever fasts Ramadan out of faith and hope for reward, his previous sins are forgiven.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 38",null,null)
B.ac5=new A.cl("Whoever prays the two cool hours (Fajr and Asr) will enter Paradise.","Abu Musa al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 574",null,null)
B.abv=new A.cl("The closest a servant is to his Lord is while he is prostrating \u2014 so make much dua.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 482",null,null)
B.abR=new A.cl("Allah descends in the last third of the night and says: Who calls upon Me that I may answer him?","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1145 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.ac9=new A.cl("Spread the greeting of peace, feed others, and pray at night while people sleep \u2014 you will enter Paradise in peace.","Abdullah ibn Salam (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2485","sahih","Darussalam")
B.abL=new A.cl("The seven whom Allah will shade on the day there is no shade but His\u2026 (among them) a person whose eyes shed tears in private out of reverence for Allah.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 660 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
